{"products": [{"id": 6766383366277, "title": "12-WATT WI-FI SMART BULB", "handle": "12-watt-wi-fi-smart-bulb", "body_html": "<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Specification:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<em data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Type: </em>Orient Wi-Fi Smart Bulb</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<em data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Light color: </em>RGB + Warm white + White</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<em data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Socket Type: </em>E27</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<em data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Material: </em>Aviation Aluminum</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<em data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Warranty: </em>1 year</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Description:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">16 million colors</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Power 12 Watt</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">AC 90-260V 50/60HZ</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">950 Lumens</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Wi-Fi Enable</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Beam Angle 180 Degree</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Application Control</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Dimmable Via App</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Smart Bulb with RGB Colors</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Sunrise and Sunset Timer</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Share Control with Your Family</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Compatible with Google Assistant and Amazon echo</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Dimmable and Instant Bright Light</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Control your room light from anywhere any time</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">LED rated up to 25000 Hours</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><em data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Lighting products instructions</em></strong></p>\n<ol data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </strong><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Preparation for use:</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Power the light bulb while ensuring that the phone is connected to the Wi-Fi network in the 2.4 GHz band.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Download and open the app:</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Download and install the App in the app store to search for \"Smart Life\u201d or scan the package/instruction on the QR code.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">If you are downloading for the\u00a0first time, please click the \"Register\" button to register.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">If you already have an account, click the \"Log in with existing account\u201d button.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\u00a0</p>\n<ol start=\"2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </strong><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Network setting</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Open the Smart Life App \u201cHome\u201d page and click the Add button \u201c+\u201d in the top right corner of the page.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">In \u201cAll Devices\u201d mode, select \u201cLighting\u201d in the left list.</li>\n</ol>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Set the device to config mode: EZ mode and AP mode</li>\n</ul>\n<ol data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">EZ Mode:</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Ensure the indicator light blinking rapidly (twice a second), click \u201cConfirm light blinks rapidly\u201d button.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Click \u201cHelp\u201d on the page to see instructions\u00a0on how to set the indicator to flash. You can refer to the operation.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\u00a0</p>\n<ol data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">AP Mode:</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Click on \u201cAP Mode\" in the upper right corner.\u00a0After seeing the light blink slowly, click the confirmation button on the page to connect to a 2.4G network. Then you will be prompted to connect to the device hotspot \u201cSmart Life-XXXX\" and click \u201cGo connect\u2019.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\u00a0</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Note: It needs to\u00a0be operated in the 2.4G network environment and does not support 5G network.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1. When the connection is successful, you can see the light bulb on\u00a0\u201cHome\"\u00a0page.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\u00a0 \u00a0 <img height=\"50\" width=\"50\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/google-play-arrow-png-logo-8_1_480x480.png?v=1672925730\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/google-play-arrow-png-logo-8_1_480x480.png?v=1672925730\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/pk/app/smart-life-smart-living/id1115101477\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img height=\"49\" width=\"49\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/App_Store_iOS_1_480x480.png?v=1672925965\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/App_Store_iOS_1_480x480.png?v=1672925965\"></a> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>", "published_at": "2024-08-27T13:17:13+05:00", "created_at": "2023-01-05T18:14:13+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:39:31+05:00", "vendor": "ORIENT Lighting", "product_type": "Bulbs", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 40068888789125, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": "500000000105", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "2400.00", "grams": 100, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 6766383366277, "created_at": "2023-01-05T18:14:14+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:39:31+05:00"}], "images": [{"id": 30355382042757, "created_at": "2023-01-05T19:03:54+05:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2023-